Secret Injection Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant Server
    participant SecretStore
    participant Kubernetes
    participant Weaver

    Server->>SecretStore: GET secrets (repo_id, org_id)
    SecretStore->>SecretStore: Decrypt secrets
    SecretStore-->>Server: Secret map

    Server->>Kubernetes: Create Pod with secrets
    Note over Kubernetes: Inject as env vars<br/>or volume mounts

    Kubernetes->>Weaver: Start container
    Note over Weaver: Secrets available as<br/>environment variables

    Weaver->>Weaver: Access secrets via env
    Note over Weaver: - LOOM_SECRET_KEY=***<br/>- GIT_TOKEN=***